  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you guys are adding this lengthy feature, this shouldnt cost money. If you have an id, you are 18. It isnt fair to people who were 18+ from the start and now have to pay because people are lying about their ages. We shouldnt have to pay because of little children's actions. At this point, just make the whole game 18+ if we are going to do this. Most people will make servers 18+ when it doesnt even need to be. There will be a lot of children leaving because they may feel excluded due to servers being 18+ for no reason. This is from a business standpoint, not out of my favor. If you want more people to play your game, it should be inclusive or atleast not make people pay for childrens actions. If it is going to be an 18+, it should NOT cost money. I do not usually give tips out, but from someone who is very familar with business standpoints, this is not necessary for it to cost money. Yes it may cost u a little bit of money to hire people, but you chose to make it that way. You will have to hire people for all sorts of things, but the customers shouldnt be paying for their service. That is a service that should be free for everyone. Imagine walking into a club, you dont just pay the bouncer for his work. You make the money from the customers buying things. I am not the only one who is infuriated by this new update with it costing money, but i am one of the few to actually speak out about it.",
